## Quickstart & Reproducible Commands

### 1. Installation

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

### 2. Run the Test Suite

```bash
pytest
```

### 3. Run the 10,000-Match Tournament & Analytical Audit

```bash
python scripts/run_tournament.py --pods 25000 --seed 42
```
